<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Harm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Necromancer (guild level 29), Healer (guild level 37)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast harm &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast harm</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The strongest of the wounding prayers: with a touch, very serious wounds open 
on the target, worse than cause serious wounds. The better your divine power 
and sphere, the deeper they go.
</p><p>Being a touch, a shield can block it. It does a little more against clothes 
than against armour. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also 
found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Light Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Serious Wounds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Deathly Grasp</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>